IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g5-interpretation`
IMPORT `g5-nouns`
IMPORT `g5-art13-reporting`
IMPORT `g5-tests-fixtures`

-- g5-tests-properties.l4: a property test of the year to which an annual return relates (Article 13(7), fork F5.2 with F5.11).
-- Whatever the reading, the years of a charity must tile the calendar: the year found for a reference day contains that day, and the year found for
-- the day after it ends is the next year, beginning on that day.  104 reference days, generated by work/g5 (month ends, month starts, 29 February,
-- 30 June, and every 61 days from 3 March 2020 to the end of 2027), all on or after the registration of the leap day charity (29 February 2020).
-- Four settings: the calendar year; the financial year ending on 30 June; the year from each anniversary of registration, 29 February clamped; the same, rolled.

§ `Property tests of the year to which the return relates`

