`the financial year end of 30 June` MEANS JUST (`Day on which a financial year ends` OF 6, 30)

GIVEN interp IS AN `Interpretation of Articles 13 and 14`
      yearEnd IS A MAYBE `Day on which a financial year ends`
      day IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the year found for the day contains the day` interp yearEnd day MEANS
    (`Art 13(7) the year to which the return relates` interp `the leap day charity` yearEnd day)'s `first day` AT MOST day
    AND day AT MOST (`Art 13(7) the year to which the return relates` interp `the leap day charity` yearEnd day)'s `last day`

GIVEN interp IS AN `Interpretation of Articles 13 and 14`
      yearEnd IS A MAYBE `Day on which a financial year ends`
      day IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the next year begins the day after this one ends` interp yearEnd day MEANS
    (`Art 13(7) the year to which the return relates` interp `the leap day charity` yearEnd ((`Art 13(7) the year to which the return relates` interp `the leap day charity` yearEnd day)'s `last day` PLUS 1))'s `first day`
    EQUALS (`Art 13(7) the year to which the return relates` interp `the leap day charity` yearEnd day)'s `last day` PLUS 1

GIVEN interp IS AN `Interpretation of Articles 13 and 14`
      yearEnd IS A MAYBE `Day on which a financial year ends`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the years tile for every sample day` interp yearEnd MEANS
        all (GIVEN day YIELD `the year found for the day contains the day` interp yearEnd day) `the sample days`
    AND all (GIVEN day YIELD `the next year begins the day after this one ends` interp yearEnd day) `the sample days`

#ASSERT `the years tile for every sample day` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 13 and 14` NOTHING
#ASSERT `the years tile for every sample day` `the interpretation with the charity's own financial year` `the financial year end of 30 June`
#ASSERT `the years tile for every sample day` `the interpretation with the year from each anniversary of registration` NOTHING
#ASSERT `the years tile for every sample day` `the interpretation with the year from each anniversary of registration and 29 February rolled` NOTHING
